### Feature DeliveryDriver — UPDATE (PUT) / UPDATE (PATCH)
### Modalidad JWT + RBAC. `status` no se envía: el estado solo cambia con
### PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-drivers/{{id}}/deactivate (borrado lógico).
@baseUrl = http://localhost:4000

# @name loginAdmin
POST {{baseUrl}}/api/sesion/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "identifier": "admin",
  "password": "Admin123!"
}

@token = {{loginAdmin.response.body.$.access_token}}
@id = 1

### UPDATE (PUT)
# @name updateDeliveryDriverPut
PUT {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-drivers/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "name": "Carlos López Actualizado",
  "description": "Repartidor del turno de la tarde"
}

### UPDATE (PATCH)
# @name updateDeliveryDriverPatch
PATCH {{baseUrl}}/api/delivery-drivers/{{id}}
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "description": "Repartidor del turno de la tarde"
}
